LANG_SPANISH         "¡Ese Spitfire ha acabado con su tanque! Ya era maldita la hora, ¿eh, muchachos?"

REFERENCE           BREAKOUT_BS2_LOOKSRETREATING
LANG_ENGLISH        "Looks like they're retreating!"
LANG_SPANISH         "¡Parece que se retiran!"

REFERENCE           BREAKOUT_BS4_ANTITANKWEAPON
