LANG_SPANISH         "¡Sin armas antitanque, la hemos cagado!"

REFERENCE           BREAKOUT_BS4_COMEBACKANYTIME
LANG_ENGLISH        "And come back any time, you Jerry bastards! We'll be waiting for you!"
